w technologies to increase the quality of your products, gain access to  new drugs and better facilities<br></li><li>\t Develop your employees skills, equipped them with best stuff or hire specialists<br></li><li>\tFight, negotiate or sabotage other drug syndicates<br></li><li>\tHire your own drug dealers or trade with friendly syndicate<br></li><li>\tUse your influences to control politics and keep the police away from your interests</li></ul>",
